import json
with open('baseline-packages.json') as f: base = json.load(f)
with open('after-cpm-packages.json') as f: after = json.load(f)
for bp, ap in zip(base['projects'], after['projects']):
    name = bp['path'].split('/')[-2]
    for bf, af in zip(bp['frameworks'], ap['frameworks']):
        bpkgs = {p['id']: p['resolvedVersion'] for p in bf.get('topLevelPackages',[])}
        apkgs = {p['id']: p['resolvedVersion'] for p in af.get('topLevelPackages',[])}
        for pkg in sorted(set(list(bpkgs.keys()) + list(apkgs.keys()))):
            bv, av = bpkgs.get(pkg,'—'), apkgs.get(pkg,'—')
            if bv != av: print(f'  CHANGED {name}/{pkg}: {bv} -> {av}')
print('Done.')
"

